                <pb facs="0537" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg465"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Municipal Council of Salza Irpina</hi>.</head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>Salza Irpina</placeName>, <date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-volume-rules" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1865-07-31T23:59:59+00:49" notBefore="1865-04-15T00:00:00+00:49"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <p>The entire municipality of Salza Irpina, full of horror for the assassination
                    consummated upon the person of the illustrious President, Abraham Lincoln,
                    deliberated unanimously to express their sentiments of grief for that horrible
                    event; also, of the sentiment of sympathy which this population feel for the
                    people of America, and for the sacred cause courageously fought for by the
                    martyrs who are now pitied by all Europe; and the municipality begs the mayor to
                    send a copy of this act to the American consul at Naples.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>CAVALIERE MICHELE CAPOZZI, <hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mayor</hi>.</item>
                            <item>FELICIANO PASQUALE, <hi rendition="#italic">Assessor</hi>.</item>
                            <item>CARMINE DE PAISOLE, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
